[00:00.25] Call up your mother, tell her that you're all alone
[00:00.25] 打电话给你母亲 告诉她你孤身一人
[00:05.39] With some sky out by Santa Fe, New Mexico
[00:05.39] 在新墨西哥州圣塔菲郊外 与一片天空相伴
[00:13.20]
[00:21.64] Think I'm going to Santa Fe, the type of place you'll know my name
[00:21.64] 我想我要去圣塔菲 那种人们会知道我名字的地方
[00:26.18] My grandma called just yesterday to say she loves the manor I was raised
[00:26.18] 祖母昨天打来电话 说她喜欢我成长的那座庄园
[00:31.68] Grown so weary of all of this and every day is a precipice
[00:31.68] 对这所有已如此厌倦 每一天都如临深渊
[00:36.19] It pissed me off and pissed on all the friends I ever made
[00:36.19] 这让我恼火 也玷污了我曾交过的所有朋友
